---
flowchart LR
  A1[浏览]:::activity --> A2[下单]:::activity --> A3[支付]:::activity
  A1 --> T1[搜索商品]:::task --> S1[按类目筛选]:::mvp
  A2 --> T2[填写地址]:::task --> S2[地址簿]:::story
  A3 --> T3[选择支付方式]:::task --> S3[分期付款]:::later
classDef activity fill:#3B6FC2,stroke:#3B6FC2,color:#FFFFFF,stroke-width:2px
classDef task fill:#D2D6F1,stroke:#9396A9,color:#1F2865
classDef story fill:#FFF6CE,stroke:#A6A086,color:#33384A
classDef mvp fill:#F6DEB6,stroke:#AC9B7F,color:#714E14
classDef later fill:#EEEFF0,stroke:#8F929B,color:#33384A
%% 用法：节点 A:::activity 或 class A,B activity
